stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> open: detected
  open --> assigned: assign (admin / reviewer)
  assigned --> in_review: start review
  in_review --> approved: approve resolution
  approved --> resolved: resolve (rename / align / deprecate / accept both) - creates a new metric version
  open --> dismissed: dismiss (note required)
  assigned --> dismissed: dismiss
  in_review --> dismissed: dismiss
  approved --> dismissed: dismiss
  dismissed --> open: reopen
  resolved --> open: reopen / re-detected with changed definitions
  resolved --> [*]
